# Google Maps Platform API Key for React + Vite (Client-side)
#
# Quickstart (Free, No Billing Required for Prototyping):
#   1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
#   2. Sign in with a Google account and accept the Maps Demo Project Terms.
#   3. Generate and copy your Maps Demo Key.
#   4. Copy this file to `.env.local` and replace the placeholder value below.
#
# Production Setup:
#   Enable Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Geocoding API, Weather API,
#   Air Quality API, Pollen API, and Solar API in Google Cloud Console, and
#   restrict your key by HTTP referrer and allowed APIs:
#   https://developers.google.com/maps/api-security-best-practices?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
VITE_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
